# What the public copy of Link (github.com/shushu-eco/link) leaves out. tools/package/publish.ps1 makes
# that copy with "git archive", which passes over everything marked export-ignore here: the owner's
# own posts, plans and notes, which are not part of the software.
discord/* export-ignore
discord/server-icon-512.png -export-ignore
ANNOUNCE_scheduler_texts.md export-ignore
LINK_overview.md export-ignore
site/DESIGN_PROMPT.md export-ignore
site/MOBILE_DESIGN_PROMPT.md export-ignore
store/TEST_REPORT.md export-ignore
# the files a user double-clicks must have Windows' line ends, whoever checks them out
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# the list of words publish.ps1 keeps out of the public copy names them, so it stays here too
tools/package/private-words.txt export-ignore
